        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions CTO150SLVSS6, Modern Wooden Door Pull with Stainless Steel Mounts and End Caps</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Contemporary Corteo Handle with Stainless Steel End Caps and Brackets is available in either satin  stainless steel, brushed stainless steel, or matte black finishes. Choose from 18 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths with thru-bolt mounting, surface mounting, or back-to-back mounting. The Stainless Steel Corteo Door Pull can be mounted on wood, fiberglass, glass, or metal doors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\nDon't see the right Wood Finish Color?  Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> and we can make it for you!\r\n<br>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/wood-door-pull-with-end-caps-first-impressions-cto150slvsbr\"><b>Wooden Door Pull</b></a> with more bracket and end cap finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Corteo 150 Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Solid Wood</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Pull End Cap Material: Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-Wood-cmbw.pdf?v=1704262249\"><b>First Impressions Wood Color Guide (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-CLB03-specifications.pdf?v=1704262327\"><b>First Impressions CTO150SLVSS6 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>CTO150018SLVSS6:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.19\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>CTO150024SLVSS6:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 15\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.19\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>CTO150036SLVSS66:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 27\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.19\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
